{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858430/extras/8a7998c003ff3569e8c72c673ed04441.avif?t=1717270755\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>Cast your line and join Sosa on an emotional journey as he navigates the mystical waters of Lake Minnewaska to fish and reconnect with his daughter. Lake Minnewaska is a narrative driven first person fishing game. Fish, explore, and uncover the secrets of Lake Minnewaska as you guide Sosa's journey in becoming a better father.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858430/extras/c4a1074a383f80fdc27b285ed4341ebb.avif?t=1717270755\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br><strong>Embark on a Personal Journey</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858430/extras/1e47139644f2f326cad9fc3b0e524b0b.poster.avif?t=1717270755\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858430/extras/1e47139644f2f326cad9fc3b0e524b0b.webm?t=1717270755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858430/extras/1e47139644f2f326cad9fc3b0e524b0b.mp4?t=1717270755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Join Sosa on his quest to reconnect with his family. Learn more about Sosa and his daughter Rue while uncovering the mystical secrets of the lake.<br><br><strong>Fish up Fantastical Creatures</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858430/extras/ab4dd6e3800fa0d1604bdb425cecc82c.poster.avif?t=1717270755\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858430/extras/ab4dd6e3800fa0d1604bdb425cecc82c.webm?t=1717270755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858430/extras/ab4dd6e3800fa0d1604bdb425cecc82c.mp4?t=1717270755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Search for the correct fishing hole based on clues in your journal and then fight to reel in the fish you've hooked. Tire out all sorts of fish by pulling your rod in the opposite direction and then reel them in to add them to your journal. Catch all the types of fish in the lake to complete Rue's fishlist.<br><br><strong>Explore Extreme Environments</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858430/extras/4d1fc0b0dd3e24c54ce98a38477684ad.poster.avif?t=1717270755\" width=600 height=374 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858430/extras/4d1fc0b0dd3e24c54ce98a38477684ad.webm?t=1717270755\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858430/extras/4d1fc0b0dd3e24c54ce98a38477684ad.mp4?t=1717270755\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Travel through a variety of lush, stormy, and mystical environments all while listening to a jazzy soundtrack. Get caught up in the ambience of the lake and the vibrant colors of the fishing holes you visit.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2858430/extras/6ea9b3b4846e54bc65b756a1f6e08b88.avif?t=1717270755\" width=600 height=100 /></span><br><br>Lake Minnewaska is an Advanced Games Project (AGP), a student-run game out of the University of Southern California, where students from the USC School of Cinematic Arts and USC School Viterbi School of Engineering, collaborate on large projects from all 